      ["Allow the discharge prescriptions to process and instruct the outpatient primary care physician to resolve medication duplications at the 4-week follow-up visit", "Allowing a patient to leave the hospital on dual full-dose direct oral anticoagulants will result in catastrophic, fatal hemorrhage within days before an outpatient visit."],
